  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Digital Democracy Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;In order to ensure that the four target countries can harness digitalisation for the benefit of all of their people, this Project will work with government officials and civil society (including NGOs, academia, the media and the private sector) to build their commitment to and understand of digital rights and digital development principles, in order to support the design of regulatory frameworks which properly respect and protect human rights in the context of digitalisation.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
